        "id": 10709,
        "name": "Cubiccube",
        "username": "Cubiccube",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/c77e96/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-07-08T19:41:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hello all.  Just letting you know that I have created a tutorial of GSF to help new players learn the game.  It is my first video ever, and would like feed back.  One warning is that I had no idea how long it would take to edit, so I only have the first two parts up and will be putting the rest up as I can.</p>\n<p>Also if anyone sees anything I have said that is incorrect, it would help to have it pointed out in the comments or put here so I can annotate it(once I figure out how.) On that point I already need to since I kind of suggested during setup to not play with the Kolvarian Wastes since it looked like it would make the game harder to me, which I now know is incorrect.</p>\n<p>Galactic Strike Force Tutorial Pt.1 Setup: <a href=\"http://youtu.be/GVWKjpyEIbI\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://youtu.be/GVWKjpyEIbI</a></p>\n<p>Galactic Strike Force Tutorial Pt.2 Travel Phase: <a href=\"http://youtu.be/Oua_DSt5odo\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://youtu.be/Oua_DSt5odo</a></p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:41:49.955Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
