        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Hello all.  Just letting you know that I have created a tutorial of GSF to help new players learn the game.  It is my first video ever, and would like feed back.  One warning is that I had no idea how long it would take to edit, so I only have the first two parts up and will be putting the rest up as I can.\r\n\r\nAlso if anyone sees anything I have said that is incorrect, it would help to have it pointed out in the comments or put here so I can annotate it(once I figure out how.) On that point I already need to since I kind of suggested during setup to not play with the Kolvarian Wastes since it looked like it would make the game harder to me, which I now know is incorrect.\r\n\r\nGalactic Strike Force Tutorial Pt.1 Setup: http://youtu.be/GVWKjpyEIbI\r\n\r\nGalactic Strike Force Tutorial Pt.2 Travel Phase: http://youtu.be/Oua_DSt5odo",
